We're counting on you, Ishizaki!

12
00:00:38,800 --> 00:00:41,260
Kids, there's a message from the coach.

13
00:00:41,260 --> 00:00:45,380
If we draw this match, we won't be able to advance to the qualifiers.

14
00:00:45,380 --> 00:00:49,900
Therefore, Tsubasa and Misaki, attack as usual.

15
00:00:50,870 --> 00:00:53,780
Alright! Let's use everything we have and score! Right, Misaki-kun?

16
00:00:53,780 --> 00:00:54,530
Yes!

17
00:00:54,530 --> 00:00:57,920
Masao, Kazuo! We're counting on you to keep this up!

18
00:00:57,920 --> 00:00:58,610
Alright!

19
00:00:58,610 --> 00:01:01,200
You keep the defense tight!

20
00:01:01,200 --> 00:01:02,520
Tsubasa-kun! Do your best!

21
00:01:02,520 --> 00:01:06,390
With Hanawa's equalizer, things have taken an interesting turn.

22
00:01:06,390 --> 00:01:09,710
The final match of the National Youth Football Tournament group stage...

23
00:01:09,710 --> 00:01:15,970
...the Nankatsu SC vs. Hanawa Youth Football Club match will resume with Nankatsu's kick-off.

24
