59
00:03:22,510 --> 00:03:27,540
4 Minutes Left! The Decisive Aerial Ball!

60
00:03:22,510 --> 00:03:27,540
Translation: ARE-YOU-SURE
www.areyousuresubs.com

61
00:03:28,260 --> 00:03:31,540
The pain in my left leg has mostly gone.

62
00:03:31,540 --> 00:03:33,700
Even so, for at least one match...

63
00:03:33,700 --> 00:03:34,810
Genzo!

64
00:03:34,810 --> 00:03:37,510
They've caught up to Nankatsu.

65
00:03:37,510 --> 00:03:39,170
What? How?

66
00:03:39,170 --> 00:03:40,780
They were in such good form.

67
00:03:40,780 --> 00:03:42,780
Hanawa's Tachibana Brothers.

68
00:03:42,780 --> 00:03:45,610
Tsubasa-kun has the ball!

69
00:03:46,620 --> 00:03:47,430
Stop him!

70
00:03:47,430 --> 00:03:47,910
Okay!

71
00:03:47,910 --> 00:03:51,660
Tsubasa-kun finds a small opening in the defense and shoots!

72
00:03:51,660 --> 00:03:55,210
The ball hits Aizawa-kun and ricochets away!

73
00:03:56,210 --> 00:03:58,380
There! Masao! Kazuo!

74
00:03:58,380 --> 00:03:59,250
Alright!

75
00:03:59,250 --> 00:04:01,550
The ball comes to the Tachibana Brothers.

76
00:04:01,550 --> 00:04:04,040
Hanawa has a chance to score another goal.

77
00:04:04,040 --> 00:04:09,270
These two, together, showed a special move they hadn't shown until now.

78
00:04:09,270 --> 00:04:10,930
A special combined move?

79
00:04:10,930 --> 00:04:12,550
Let's do it again, Kazuo!

80
00:04:12,550 --> 00:04:13,430
Alright!

81
00:04:15,410 --> 00:04:16,270
This--

82
00:04:16,830 --> 00:04:18,310
The same move as before!

83
00:04:18,310 --> 00:04:19,110
We'll stop it!

84
00:04:19,110 --> 00:04:22,990
Nankatsu quickly goes after Masao-kun!

85
00:04:22,990 --> 00:04:24,990
I'm leaving it to you, Matsumoto.

86
00:04:24,990 --> 00:04:27,110
Masao-kun makes a back pass...

87
00:04:27,910 --> 00:04:30,590
...and starts running towards the goal!

88
00:04:30,590 --> 00:04:31,450
What?!

89
00:04:32,830 --> 00:04:34,710
Here they come, Masao, Kazuo!

90
00:04:35,930 --> 00:04:38,540
Matsumoto sends a high ball!

91
00:04:38,540 --> 00:04:42,460
Both Masao-kun and Kazuo-kun run forward!

92
00:04:46,220 --> 00:04:47,680
This--

93
00:04:48,340 --> 00:04:52,060
We see the twins' aerial acrobatic moves again!

94
00:04:52,060 --> 00:04:53,030
This time...

95
00:04:53,030 --> 00:04:54,520
Both jumped at the same time!

96
00:04:54,520 --> 00:04:55,560
Which one...

97
00:04:55,560 --> 00:04:57,400
Which one will strike?

98
00:04:58,610 --> 00:05:02,070
Masao-kun aims for the goal with a mid-air volley!

99
00:05:02,070 --> 00:05:04,990
Will Hanawa finally take the lead?

100
00:05:06,120 --> 00:05:09,530
No! Goalkeeper Morisaki punches it away!

101
00:05:09,530 --> 00:05:10,280
What?!

102
00:05:11,330 --> 00:05:12,990
You did it, Morisaki!

103
00:05:12,990 --> 00:05:15,200
The ball goes to Ishizaki-kun at the back.

104
00:05:15,200 --> 00:05:18,260
Alright, Ishizaki! Pass to Tsubasa and Misaki!

105
00:05:18,260 --> 00:05:19,460
Alright!

106
00:05:19,460 --> 00:05:20,170
What?!

107
00:05:20,540 --> 00:05:21,400
No way!

108
00:05:21,400 --> 00:05:23,300
No way! He missed!

109
00:05:24,880 --> 00:05:29,720
It went into the goal! Nankatsu scored an own goal!

110
00:05:31,470 --> 00:05:33,170
We did it! We did it! We're so lucky!

111
00:05:33,170 --> 00:05:34,930
We scored our second goal!

112
00:05:38,570 --> 00:05:41,190
Idiot. They fielded someone like this.

113
00:05:41,190 --> 00:05:44,900
Things are moving in our favor.

114
00:05:44,900 --> 00:05:47,070
What are you doing, Ishizaki?!

115
00:05:47,070 --> 00:05:49,280
How could you score an own goal?!

116
00:05:49,280 --> 00:05:51,200
I-I'm sorry...

117
00:05:51,200 --> 00:05:55,400
We have to win this match at all costs!

118
00:05:55,400 --> 00:05:56,480
And you--

119
00:05:56,480 --> 00:05:57,360
Don't!

120
00:05:58,330 --> 00:06:00,160
Misaki...

121
00:06:00,160 --> 00:06:03,250
Please don't fight among yourselves.

122
00:06:03,250 --> 00:06:09,510
I didn't want to say it yet, but this tournament might be our last match together.

123
00:06:09,510 --> 00:06:11,280
What?

124
00:06:11,280 --> 00:06:12,340
Misaki...

125
00:06:12,340 --> 00:06:15,220
So please, stop fighting.

126
00:06:15,220 --> 00:06:17,400
Misaki-kun...

127
00:06:17,400 --> 00:06:19,210
So you're going to...

128
00:06:19,210 --> 00:06:20,230
Transfer again?

129
00:06:20,860 --> 00:06:21,810
Yes.

130
00:06:22,850 --> 00:06:25,770
But even if I change schools...

131
00:06:25,770 --> 00:06:32,620
...the one and only team I've ever been able to join and play with in a national tournament is Nankatsu.

132
00:06:32,620 --> 00:06:37,660
That's why, no matter what, I want to win and become champions together.

133
00:06:38,250 --> 00:06:39,410
Misaki...

134
00:06:44,170 --> 00:06:46,830
Come on, everyone. The match is starting now.

135
00:06:46,830 --> 00:06:50,260
Let's definitely turn this match around for Misaki-kun!

136
00:06:50,260 --> 00:06:52,260
Tsubasa...

137
00:06:52,260 --> 00:06:53,900
Yes, exactly!

138
00:06:53,900 --> 00:06:55,330
The match is starting now!

139
00:06:55,330 --> 00:06:56,010
Yes!

140
00:06:56,010 --> 00:06:57,940
Let's definitely turn it around!

141
00:06:57,940 --> 00:07:01,210
We'll be the ones advancing to the qualifiers!

142
00:07:01,960 --> 00:07:02,600
Morisaki-kun!

143
00:07:04,280 --> 00:07:04,860
Here.

144
00:07:06,240 --> 00:07:08,610
Alright, everyone. Give it your all.

145
00:07:08,610 --> 00:07:10,490
Yes!

146
00:07:10,490 --> 00:07:12,000
That's it! Don't lose!

147
00:07:12,000 --> 00:07:13,510
Make a quick comeback!

148
00:07:13,510 --> 00:07:15,940
Push, Nankatsu!

149
00:07:15,940 --> 00:07:19,360
Ishizaki-kun, don't let it bother you, don't.

150
00:07:20,200 --> 00:07:21,120
Okay.

151
00:07:21,120 --> 00:07:22,950
Complete idiots.

152
00:07:22,950 --> 00:07:25,290
Now that we've taken the lead by one goal, the match is ours.

153
00:07:25,290 --> 00:07:29,590
Nankatsu has fallen into a difficult situation with that unfortunate goal.

154
00:07:29,590 --> 00:07:34,720
To advance to the qualifiers, they must win this match.

155
00:07:34,720 --> 00:07:37,170
Unless they score two goals and win...

156
00:07:37,170 --> 00:07:40,100
...they won't be able to advance.

157
00:07:42,940 --> 00:07:44,700
The match continues.

158
00:07:44,700 --> 00:07:48,110
With the change in the game's flow, Nankatsu quickly attacks Hanawa!

159
00:07:48,110 --> 00:07:50,150
Alright, first let's score a goal!

160
00:07:50,150 --> 00:07:51,030
Okay!

161
00:07:51,630 --> 00:07:54,160
Tsubasa-kun, please win this.

162
00:07:54,160 --> 00:07:57,870
I'm dying to play against you.

163
00:07:57,870 --> 00:08:03,120
To make a comeback, Nankatsu was attacking with all their might.

164
00:08:03,120 --> 00:08:04,920
You! Push!

165
00:08:04,920 --> 00:08:06,130
I'll stop you right here!

166
00:08:06,890 --> 00:08:10,550
However, Hanawa's defense was tight.

167
00:08:11,900 --> 00:08:12,800
Tsubasa!

168
00:08:13,500 --> 00:08:16,510
The pass to Tsubasa-kun was intercepted.

169
00:08:16,510 --> 00:08:21,060
Taki-kun runs, but Oizumi-kun doesn't allow it.

170
00:08:21,660 --> 00:08:24,690
Matsumoto-kun sends the ball out for a throw-in.

171
00:08:24,690 --> 00:08:26,450
Nankatsu attacks with everything...

172
00:08:26,450 --> 00:08:29,820
...but they can't break through Hanawa's solid defense and score!

173
00:08:30,610 --> 00:08:32,400
What are you doing, kids?

174
00:08:36,640 --> 00:08:37,490
Damn it!

175
00:08:38,010 --> 00:08:40,160
It's all my fault!

176
00:08:40,160 --> 00:08:42,620
The match will continue with Nankatsu's throw-in.

177
00:08:42,620 --> 00:08:43,790
Over here!

178
00:08:44,520 --> 00:08:45,040
What?

179
00:08:46,960 --> 00:08:47,630
Take it!

180
00:08:48,540 --> 00:08:51,800
The ball goes to Taki-kun. He attacks once more.

181
00:08:51,800 --> 00:08:58,430
However, Nankatsu is in a very difficult situation, unable to send the ball to the completely marked Tsubasa-kun!

182
00:08:58,430 --> 00:08:59,050
Damn it!

183
00:08:59,050 --> 00:09:03,840
Marking Hyuga in the Meiwa match taught us a good lesson!

184
00:09:03,840 --> 00:09:05,060
Exactly.

185
00:09:05,060 --> 00:09:09,130
It's hard to pass to Tsubasa in this marking.

186
00:09:10,010 --> 00:09:11,070
Taki!

187
00:09:11,070 --> 00:09:12,350
Over here!

188
00:09:12,350 --> 00:09:15,440
Kisugi-kun from Nankatsu runs to the opposite side!

189
00:09:15,440 --> 00:09:18,240
There's a reason they call me the goal-getter of Shutetsu!

190
00:09:18,240 --> 00:09:21,620
With this, I'll bring the equalizer!

191
00:09:21,620 --> 00:09:22,870
A quick shot!

192
00:09:23,790 --> 00:09:27,040
Goalkeeper Kobayashi-kun jumps and catches it!

193
00:09:27,040 --> 00:09:28,710
Nice save!

194
00:09:28,710 --> 00:09:29,710
Damn it!

195
00:09:29,710 --> 00:09:31,030
Push!

196
00:09:31,030 --> 00:09:33,800
We beg you, Nankatsu! Pull yourselves together quickly!

197
00:09:33,800 --> 00:09:36,430
Don't let them catch up, Hanawa!

198
00:09:36,430 --> 00:09:40,310
With the qualifiers ticket at stake, the Nankatsu-Hanawa match continues!

199
00:09:40,310 --> 00:09:44,950
15 minutes have passed and only 5 minutes remain.

200
00:09:44,950 --> 00:09:47,560
It seems this is as far as Nankatsu goes.

201
00:09:47,560 --> 00:09:51,440
It's very clear how well Hanawa has withstood Nankatsu's attacks.

202
00:09:51,440 --> 00:09:55,860
They believe they'll win by protecting their one-goal lead and...

203
00:09:55,860 --> 00:09:57,950
...they aren't bowing to the pressure.

204
00:09:57,950 --> 00:09:59,910
Hanawa's defense is amazing.

205
00:09:59,910 --> 00:10:00,910
Izawa!

206
00:10:01,960 --> 00:10:02,780
Got it!

207
00:10:02,780 --> 00:10:03,740
Oh no!

208
00:10:03,740 --> 00:10:06,470
Nankatsu is badly caught out!

209
00:10:06,470 --> 00:10:08,660
The ball is taken by Hanawa.

210
00:10:08,660 --> 00:10:09,580
Take it!

211
00:10:09,580 --> 00:10:12,230
A long pass comes to the Tachibana Brothers up front!

212
00:10:12,230 --> 00:10:14,630
If Nankatsu concedes another goal...

213
00:10:14,630 --> 00:10:18,090
...their hope of advancing to the qualifiers will end!

214
00:10:18,090 --> 00:10:20,380
Alright! Let's score another goal and seal it!

215
00:10:23,210 --> 00:10:23,990
What?!

216
00:10:23,990 --> 00:10:25,920
What?! An amazing move!

217
00:10:25,920 --> 00:10:28,770
Defender Ishizaki-kun intercepts the ball!

218
00:10:28,770 --> 00:10:29,770
- Ishizaki-kun!
- Ishizaki-kun!

219
00:10:29,770 --> 00:10:30,770
Ishizaki!

220
00:10:30,770 --> 00:10:33,310
Ishizaki-kun dribbles the ball.

221
00:10:33,310 --> 00:10:36,840
We fell behind because of me.

222
00:10:36,840 --> 00:10:39,250
After everyone has won so much...

223
00:10:39,250 --> 00:10:41,570
...I'll never let it end like this!

224
00:10:41,570 --> 00:10:43,200
Ishizaki-kun!

225
00:10:43,200 --> 00:10:46,540
For the sake of Misaki, who will transfer...

226
00:10:47,780 --> 00:10:50,830
...I'll return that goal!

227
00:10:50,830 --> 00:10:53,630
Ishizaki-kun takes a long shot!

228
00:10:53,630 --> 00:10:55,040
Alright.

229
00:10:55,040 --> 00:10:58,300
But it goes directly at the goalkeeper.

230
00:11:00,620 --> 00:11:04,680
What?! Misaki-kun slides and changes the direction of the ball!

231
00:11:05,880 --> 00:11:07,430
Goal!

232
00:11:07,430 --> 00:11:10,420
Nankatsu equalizes with 4 minutes left!

233
00:11:10,420 --> 00:11:12,190
They've finally gotten the equalizer!

234
00:11:12,950 --> 00:11:14,560
2-2. A draw.

235
00:11:14,560 --> 00:11:17,620
With this, we're back to square one!

236
00:11:17,620 --> 00:11:20,790
We did it!

237
00:11:24,030 --> 00:11:29,000
Translation: ARE-YOU-SURE
www.areyousuresubs.com

238
00:11:30,760 --> 00:11:32,540
Nankatsu equalizes!

239
00:11:32,540 --> 00:11:35,350
Th-Thanks, Misaki!

240
00:11:35,350 --> 00:11:38,910
With only 4 minutes left in the second half, the equalizer is scored!

241
00:11:38,910 --> 00:11:40,460
It's tied!

242
00:11:40,460 --> 00:11:42,760
That was an amazing play.

243
00:11:42,760 --> 00:11:45,240
Misaki-kun's planned touch.

244
00:11:45,240 --> 00:11:50,140
And the long shot Ishizaki-kun took after intercepting wonderfully!

245
00:11:50,140 --> 00:11:54,560
It was a great play that made up for his previous mistake!

246
00:11:54,560 --> 00:11:59,720
You're someone who always somehow finds a way out of a difficult situation, Ishizaki.

247
00:11:59,720 --> 00:12:03,400
Alright! Let's score one more and win!

248
00:12:03,400 --> 00:12:04,660
Yes!

249
00:12:04,660 --> 00:12:09,660
That's it, Ishizaki! You trained like a beast with everyone!

250
00:12:09,660 --> 00:12:11,310
Keep it up!

251
00:12:12,120 --> 00:12:18,750
However, Nankatsu needs to score one more goal in 4 minutes to advance to the qualifiers.

252
00:12:18,750 --> 00:12:23,920
Meanwhile, the draw works in Hanawa's favor.

253
00:12:23,920 --> 00:12:27,180
Damn it! We must absolutely protect the goal we scored!

254
00:12:27,180 --> 00:12:30,510
Which team will the goddess of victory smile upon?

255
00:12:30,510 --> 00:12:34,140
The excitement is at its peak in the match!

256
00:12:34,140 --> 00:12:36,370
You've come this far.

257
00:12:36,370 --> 00:12:38,900
Hanawa, handle it somehow.

258
00:12:39,900 --> 00:12:44,400
Score one more goal and advance to the qualifiers, Tsubasa-kun.

259
00:12:47,080 --> 00:12:50,580
So we need to score one more goal!

260
00:12:51,020 --> 00:12:54,820
The match resumes with the Tachibana Brothers dribbling!

261
00:12:54,820 --> 00:12:57,960
Let's steal the ball before they do their aerial acrobatic moves!

262
00:12:58,410 --> 00:12:59,040
Yes!

263
00:13:02,210 --> 00:13:06,150
After equalizing, Nankatsu is very fired up!

264
00:13:06,150 --> 00:13:08,260
They aren't letting the Tachibana Brothers do what they want!

265
00:13:08,260 --> 00:13:09,390
Let's go!

266
00:13:10,300 --> 00:13:11,390
Masao!

267
00:13:15,020 --> 00:13:17,270
Masao-kun is being closely pursued!

268
00:13:17,980 --> 00:13:18,560
Damn it!

269
00:13:19,660 --> 00:13:23,110
However, the Tachibana Brothers don't lose the ball that easily!

270
00:13:24,440 --> 00:13:25,670
We'll steal the ball now!

271
00:13:25,670 --> 00:13:26,360
Yes!

272
00:13:29,240 --> 00:13:32,990
Masao-kun quickly dodges two players!

273
00:13:32,990 --> 00:13:34,370
Nice, Masao!

274
00:13:34,370 --> 00:13:36,330
Oh no! Go after them!

275
00:13:36,330 --> 00:13:40,130
The Tachibana Brothers are approaching Nankatsu's defensive area!

276
00:13:40,130 --> 00:13:44,130
I will steal this ball no matter what.

277
00:13:44,130 --> 00:13:47,630
Nankatsu catches up to Masao-kun.

278
00:13:49,140 --> 00:13:50,590
Kazuo!

279
00:13:50,590 --> 00:13:51,350
Alright!

280
00:13:51,350 --> 00:13:57,350
Misaki-kun reads the aerial ball and intercepts the Tachibana Brothers' pass!

281
00:13:57,350 --> 00:13:58,140
Oh no!

282
00:13:58,140 --> 00:14:00,190
Nice interception, Misaki!

283
00:14:00,190 --> 00:14:03,270
Alright, I won't lose either!

284
00:14:05,050 --> 00:14:07,800
Nankatsu finally gets the ball!

285
00:14:07,800 --> 00:14:09,660
They're advancing quickly towards Hanawa's goal!

286
00:14:09,660 --> 00:14:11,940
If we let them score, it's over!

287
00:14:11,940 --> 00:14:14,350
Protect the goal until the very end!

288
00:14:14,350 --> 00:14:15,160
Okay!

289
00:14:15,160 --> 00:14:17,820
Nankatsu's attack and Hanawa's defense.

290
00:14:17,820 --> 00:14:21,080
Their final struggle will determine who goes to the qualifiers!

291
00:14:22,100 --> 00:14:23,000
There!

292
00:14:23,000 --> 00:14:25,000
Misaki-kun takes a quick shot!

293
00:14:25,760 --> 00:14:28,010
But the ball hits the defense and goes out.

294
00:14:28,810 --> 00:14:30,760
Nankatsu will take a corner.

295
00:14:30,760 --> 00:14:32,210
Look at that.

296
00:14:32,210 --> 00:14:35,990
Hanawa is on defense with all their players, leaving the Tachibana Brothers aside!

297
00:14:35,990 --> 00:14:38,350
They've built an incredible wall in front of the goal!

298
00:14:38,350 --> 00:14:42,610
Will Nankatsu be able to overcome this wall and score?

299
00:14:42,610 --> 00:14:45,520
Only 3 minutes left.

300
00:14:51,360 --> 00:14:52,360
Hurry, Taki!

301
00:14:57,120 --> 00:14:58,800
Towards the front of the goal!

302
00:14:58,800 --> 00:15:01,080
Will Nankatsu make a header?

303
00:15:01,850 --> 00:15:04,610
Goalkeeper Kobayashi-kun punches it away!

304
00:15:04,610 --> 00:15:05,750
An amazing decision!

305
00:15:05,750 --> 00:15:07,630
Nice, goalkeeper!

306
00:15:07,630 --> 00:15:10,630
But the ball falls in front of Tsubasa-kun.

307
00:15:10,630 --> 00:15:11,470
Alright!

308
00:15:11,470 --> 00:15:13,970
The goalkeeper still hasn't gotten up.

309
00:15:13,970 --> 00:15:16,030
Tsubasa-kun shoots!

310
00:15:20,030 --> 00:15:22,940
T-Tsubasa's shot was blocked with his body.

311
00:15:23,550 --> 00:15:26,270
That's Tachibana Masao-kun!

312
00:15:26,270 --> 00:15:28,480
Keep it up, Hanawa!

313
00:15:28,480 --> 00:15:33,490
The Tachibana Brothers, who shouldn't be on defense, have come back to defend!

314
00:15:34,400 --> 00:15:37,330
Even if I die, I won't let you score!

315
00:15:38,450 --> 00:15:41,370
You two are worth a hundred men!

316
00:15:41,370 --> 00:15:43,420
Yes, leave it to us!

317
00:15:43,420 --> 00:15:48,210
With the Tachibana Brothers joining the defense, everyone is now defending!

318
00:15:48,760 --> 00:15:52,210
The Hanawa wall is thicker than ever.

319
00:15:52,210 --> 00:15:54,220
With a team as famous for its defense as Hanawa...

320
00:15:54,220 --> 00:15:59,310
...having doubled their defense, Nankatsu can't even shoot!

321
00:16:00,480 --> 00:16:02,770
The 20 minutes of the second half have expired.

322
00:16:02,770 --> 00:16:04,900
There's 1 minute of added time.

323
00:16:04,900 --> 00:16:06,770
Nankatsu's chances are running out.

324
00:16:06,770 --> 00:16:09,330
Tsubasa-kun! Misaki-kun! Do something!

325
00:16:09,330 --> 00:16:10,780
There's no time left!

326
00:16:15,030 --> 00:16:17,040
Alright, just a little more.

327
00:16:17,040 --> 00:16:20,410
I will never let you shoot.

328
00:16:20,410 --> 00:16:24,920
How can we get past such a huge defense?

329
00:16:36,000 --> 00:16:40,140
Will this be my last match with everyone?

330
00:16:40,140 --> 00:16:42,680
I won't let it end here!

331
00:16:43,680 --> 00:16:46,300
Nankatsu will win!

332
00:16:46,300 --> 00:16:48,610
As captain, I can't accept any other outcome!

333
00:16:50,400 --> 00:16:52,400
Misaki-kun, up high!

334
00:16:54,730 --> 00:16:55,820
I understand!

335
00:16:55,820 --> 00:17:01,450
Misaki-kun, at Tsubasa-kun's signal, sends a high ball!

336
00:17:01,450 --> 00:17:02,330
What are they up to?

337
00:17:02,330 --> 00:17:04,660
Masao, could that be--

338
00:17:06,580 --> 00:17:10,910
Th-This is the Tachibana Brothers' special aerial move!

339
00:17:10,910 --> 00:17:13,090
Tsubasa-kun is doing the same thing!

340
00:17:13,090 --> 00:17:16,590
No one is holding him while he's in the air!

341
00:17:18,380 --> 00:17:21,470
Tsubasa-kun performs an overhead kick in mid-air!

342
00:17:22,540 --> 00:17:25,430
It went in! Goal!

343
00:17:27,010 --> 00:17:28,900
Nankatsu turned it around!

344
00:17:28,900 --> 00:17:30,020
Tsubasa-kun!

345
00:17:30,020 --> 00:17:31,900
We did it! We came back!

346
00:17:31,900 --> 00:17:34,290
You did it, Tsubasa!

347
00:17:37,490 --> 00:17:39,990
The final whistle blows.

348
00:17:40,480 --> 00:17:43,740
With a last-ditch effort, the match ends 3-2!

349
00:17:43,740 --> 00:17:49,250
Those who seize victory at the last moment are Nankatsu SC from the Shizuoka region!

350
00:17:49,250 --> 00:17:57,380
Thus, Nankatsu has secured their participation in the qualifiers, finishing behind Meiwa FC!

351
00:17:57,380 --> 00:17:58,690
We did it! We did it!

352
00:17:58,690 --> 00:17:59,840
We've advanced to the qualifiers!

353
00:17:59,840 --> 00:18:00,850
You're amazing!

354
00:18:01,410 --> 00:18:02,850
Tsubasa-kun...

355
00:18:04,060 --> 00:18:05,350
Congratulations.

356
00:18:06,010 --> 00:18:11,360
Thank you, Tsubasa-kun. With this, I can continue playing football with everyone.

357
00:18:11,360 --> 00:18:13,480
Nankatsu overcame the difficult situation.

358
00:18:12,870 --> 00:18:13,480
Yes.

359
00:18:13,480 --> 00:18:16,440
They advance to the qualifiers with a 3-2 score.

360
00:18:14,040 --> 00:18:16,440
I broke out in a cold sweat here.

361
00:18:16,440 --> 00:18:18,450
You did it, Tsubasa-kun!

362
00:18:18,450 --> 00:18:22,740
I can't wait to play against you, Tsubasa-kun.

363
00:18:22,740 --> 00:18:26,750
Nankatsu really pulled it off.

364
00:18:26,750 --> 00:18:30,000
Roberto, Tsubasa really did it.

365
00:18:31,930 --> 00:18:33,340
Roberto?

366
00:18:33,340 --> 00:18:34,990
You were great, Hanawa!

367
00:18:34,990 --> 00:18:36,590
Nankatsu, congratulations!

368
00:18:36,590 --> 00:18:38,440
Damn it!

369
00:18:38,440 --> 00:18:40,590
We were so close to advancing to the qualifiers.

370
00:18:40,590 --> 00:18:43,280
We fought with everything we had.

371
00:18:43,280 --> 00:18:45,430
Let's hold our heads high until the very end.

372
00:18:46,240 --> 00:18:47,100
Yes.

373
00:18:47,100 --> 00:18:49,350
Thank you for your support!

374
00:18:50,020 --> 00:18:51,850
Try again!

375
00:18:54,430 --> 00:18:58,150
Do your best in the qualifiers on our behalf too.

376
00:18:58,150 --> 00:18:59,200
Yes.

377
00:19:15,750 --> 00:19:21,540
He doesn't hesitate to apply any known football technique.

378
00:19:22,190 --> 00:19:26,060
Tsubasa, I remember the first time we met.

379
00:19:29,370 --> 00:19:31,730
Even if I hadn't taught you anything...

380
00:19:31,730 --> 00:19:34,980
...you kept improving in every match.

381
00:19:38,000 --> 00:19:43,190
Maybe Tsubasa doesn't need me anymore.

382
00:19:48,130 --> 00:19:52,990
The group stage of the National Youth Football Tournament had ended.

383
00:19:52,990 --> 00:19:57,800
The 16 teams advancing to the qualifiers had gathered here.

384
00:19:58,370 --> 00:20:00,880
So you're really going to change schools?

385
00:20:00,880 --> 00:20:04,970
Yes. I'll transfer to another school in the second term.

386
00:20:05,390 --> 00:20:06,310
I see.

387
00:20:07,260 --> 00:20:10,980
Then we have no choice but to become champions together with Misaki-kun.

388
00:20:10,980 --> 00:20:12,690
Tsubasa-kun...

389
00:20:12,690 --> 00:20:15,760
I'll never let Misaki leave as a loser.

390
00:20:15,760 --> 00:20:17,250
Alright! To the championship!

391
00:20:17,250 --> 00:20:18,870
We'll become champions with Misaki!

392
00:20:19,580 --> 00:20:21,120
Thanks, guys!

393
00:20:21,120 --> 00:20:23,150
Hey, Misaki!

394
00:20:23,850 --> 00:20:25,360
The kids from Furano.

395
00:20:25,360 --> 00:20:28,450
You were amazing in today's match, Misaki.

396
00:20:28,450 --> 00:20:31,500
According to the qualifiers draw...

397
00:20:31,500 --> 00:20:35,480
...Furano and Nankatsu won't play each other until the final.

398
00:20:35,480 --> 00:20:37,040
Yes, you're right.

399
00:20:37,040 --> 00:20:40,860
If possible, let's hope the final match is between Nankatsu and Furano.

400
00:20:40,860 --> 00:20:42,300
Yes, exactly!

401
00:20:43,170 --> 00:20:50,260
Even though I keep changing schools, thanks to football, I've made so many friends.

402
00:20:50,260 --> 00:20:52,690
Captain, the meeting is about to start.

403
00:20:52,690 --> 00:20:54,140
Alright, got it.

404
00:20:54,540 --> 00:20:56,120
See you, Misaki.

405
00:21:00,490 --> 00:21:01,270
Sorry.

406
00:21:03,980 --> 00:21:04,950
Captain!

407
00:21:04,950 --> 00:21:06,910
Idiot! Watch where you're going!

408
00:21:06,910 --> 00:21:07,950
Kojiro!

409
00:21:09,030 --> 00:21:10,630
Bastard!

410
00:21:10,630 --> 00:21:12,250
Don't, Matsuyama!

411
00:21:12,250 --> 00:21:13,440
Misaki...

412
00:21:13,440 --> 00:21:18,020
Misaki, just because you advanced to the qualifiers, don't get cocky!

413
00:21:18,020 --> 00:21:18,710
What?

414
00:21:18,710 --> 00:21:21,710
After all, it's obvious that Meiwa will be the winner!

415
00:21:21,710 --> 00:21:23,960
I'm sick and tired of this!

416
00:21:23,960 --> 00:21:26,880
Don't! Decide this on the field!

417
00:21:27,880 --> 00:21:29,340
Tsubasa-kun...

418
00:21:31,010 --> 00:21:36,640
Tsubasa-kun is right. Getting injured before the match could be a problem.

419
00:21:36,640 --> 00:21:39,020
Misugi Jun...

420
00:21:39,020 --> 00:21:42,780
You seem to be having fun.

421
00:21:42,780 --> 00:21:44,720
O-Oh...

422
00:21:44,720 --> 00:21:47,360
Nakanishi, the goalkeeper of Naniwa FC!

423
00:21:47,360 --> 00:21:52,540
Nankatsu guys, if I'm not mistaken, the first match of the qualifiers will be between us.

424
00:21:52,540 --> 00:21:55,830
Let's get along, okay?

425
00:22:06,590 --> 00:22:09,540
Everyone looks very strong, Tsubasa-kun.

426
00:22:09,540 --> 00:22:12,600
Yes. I can't wait for our matches.

427
00:22:13,040 --> 00:22:17,380
Alright! Wait for us, qualifiers!

